+## STOR5 - immutable deduplication and authenticated cold archival - implemented in 0.20.116a0
 
-After ownership/accounting and lifecycle cleanup are qualified, immutable campaign
-artifacts may be deduplicated by content. Same-filesystem hardlinks or copy-on-write
-reflinks are preferred where supported; fallback remains ordinary atomic copy.
-Logical and physical storage accounting must distinguish these cases.
-
-Cold artifacts that are no longer latency-sensitive may optionally be converted from
-mmap-friendly hot representations to compressed archives with authenticated manifests.
